      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6b3cc227a56787575ebb4|full_name}: this same argument has been used to argue against the public avatar optimization guidelines. The answer is that the bot is sometimes randomly re-run, and if you are caught doing this your world submission privileges will be suspended for a month, at best.\n\nReplacing ID's is also significantly harder than just running around in a malicious avatar and having people clone it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
